Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): ids on other gateways (hub replica) are not
 phantom refs in completion prose [daveey]

---
 hermes_cli/kanban_db.py                       |  20 +++-
 hermes_cli/kanban_diagnostics.py              |  11 +-
 hermes_cli/kanban_session_activity.py         |  30 +++++
 tests/hermes_cli/test_kanban_false_signals.py | 105 ++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 162 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)
